[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛、汉娜、雪莉，还有梅露露，<br>她们四个不得不<br>给监牢作一次大规模的扫除。|#0103Adv15_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，雪莉的这场“暴动”，<br>却给少女们意外带来了转机。|#0103Adv15_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:墙壁上被打出了一个缺口，<br>而看守和典狱长似乎<br>都没有发现这件事。|#0103Adv15_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守们例行检查时，<br>也只是透过窗口粗略观察囚犯是否身在牢房内。<br>这意味着，夜晚或许有可能悄悄溜出去。|#0103Adv15_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉很快进行了试验：<br>用床上的毯子堆出人形，并在夜间外出。<br>这个尝试竟然成功了。|#0103Adv15_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然需要承担几分风险，<br>但能够获得更多自由活动的时间。<br>少女们都或多或少从这个意外收获中得了好处。|#0103Adv15_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后——|#0103Adv15_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:19_2 SubId:Middle

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR16 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:大家～！往这边来！|#0103Adv15_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆声を潜めて

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉，小声点！<br>要是被发现就完蛋了～！|#0103Adv15_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:晚、晚上的气氛好吓人……|#0103Adv15_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，不过夜间偷溜出来<br>还挺让人兴奋的。|#0103Adv15_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们从牢房中悄悄溜出，<br>开始了夜间的秘密探索。|#0103Adv15_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉在前方带路，少女们借着朦胧的月光，<br>小心翼翼地走在石砖铺就的小径上。|#0103Adv15_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:监牢周围难得没有监视猫头鹰盘旋。<br>夜色格外静谧。<br>|#0103Adv15_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然有些冒险，但说不定能去那个地方看看……<br>　只要有足够的时间，一定能发现些什么）|#0103Adv15_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，这边！|#0103Adv15_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，好、好的！|#0103Adv15_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:沉浸在思绪中的艾玛被雪莉唤回现实，<br>连忙跑向同伴们。|#0103Adv15_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆声を潜めて

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉，<br>不是说了要小声一点吗！？|#0103Adv15_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:知道啦。|#0103Adv15_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过你看，它们大概觉得有围墙就万无一失，<br>根本没人来巡逻呢。|#0103Adv15_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是说，除非能越过那道围墙，<br>否则我们永远逃不出去吧……|#0103Adv15_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:要是能翻过那道墙的话……|#0103Adv15_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜痛苦地低语，随后用力摇头，仿佛要甩开这不切实际的念头。|#0103Adv15_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:话说回来，雪莉，<br>你到底要带我们去哪里？|#0103Adv15_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:不知不觉间，<br>一行人已经来到了监牢的后方。<br>艾玛记得自己在探索时曾多次来过这片区域。|#0103Adv15_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这附近应该有一扇打不开的门……）|#0103Adv15_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正如艾玛所想，<br>雪莉在一扇厚重的铁门前停下了脚步。|#0103Adv15_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这扇门虽然属于监牢建筑的一部分，<br>却无法从内部进入。<br>也就是说，只能从外面打开。|#0103Adv15_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:嘿嘿嘿。<br>我说过发现了不得了的东西吧？|#0103Adv15_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉得意地说着，<br>轻而易举地推开了铁门。|#0103Adv15_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 鉄製の扉を開く音
