[PrintTextModified Text:——映入眼帘的是一个宽敞的仓库。<br>混凝土地面上整齐排列着各式的置物架。<br>|#0103Adv15_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:上面密密麻麻堆满了各种物资、<br>材料和纸箱。|#0103Adv15_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:竟然还有这种地方！？|#0103Adv15_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:好多物资啊……<br>但是，为什么门会开着呢？|#0103Adv15_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:大概只有在我们被禁止外出的时间段，<br>门才会开着吧。|#0103Adv15_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这里储存着囚犯的生活用品和食物，<br>推测看守会在夜间搬运。|#0103Adv15_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:那、<br>那岂不是随时可能有看守过来……？|#0103Adv15_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:到时候再说！<br>这里这么大，完全可以躲起来！|#0103Adv15_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:快、快看，这里有好多罐头……！|#0103Adv15_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:顺着梅露露的声音望去，<br>只见那边堆满了食品罐头。|#0103Adv15_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:终于可以摆脱那些难吃的食物了……！|#0103Adv15_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，汉娜……<br>这些好像都是那种可怕食物的罐头哦？|#0103Adv15_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:噫噫噫！|#0103Adv15_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜不死心地<br>开始寻找其他种类的罐头。<br>梅露露也显得有些兴奋。|#0103Adv15_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:如果能找到面粉和白糖的话，<br>就可以做点心和面包了……！|#0103Adv15_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一定要找到啊，梅露露！|#0103Adv15_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好的……！|#0103Adv15_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛正在仔细观察各种物资，<br>这时雪莉靠了过来。|#0103Adv15_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:为了把我们关在这座岛上，<br>它们竟储备了这么多东西。|#0103Adv15_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我本以为既然有招待所，<br>应该会定期有人从岛外来访。|#0103Adv15_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但储备既然这么充足，<br>看来会有外界访客的可能性很低啊。|#0103Adv15_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊……|#0103Adv15_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我还想着如果有直升机来，<br>说不定能劫机逃走呢……<br>真可惜。|#0103Adv15_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，虽然发现仓库是个重大突破……<br>但似乎还是找不到逃脱的办法呢……|#0103Adv15_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜和梅露露正沉浸在寻找食材的兴奋中，<br>似乎还没有意识到这一点。|#0103Adv15_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:（不能这么消极啊）|#0103Adv15_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们也来找找看有什么好东西吧！<br>说不定能发现可以用来越狱的工具！|#0103Adv15_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:说得对！|#0103Adv15_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

